WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:00.934 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Our first guest tonight

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
is an Academy Award-winning
actress

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:05.372
you know from such films
as "Les Miserables," "Oceans 8,"

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:06.172 line:92%
and "The Devil Wears Prada."

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:08.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's currently
starring in "Serenity,"

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:10.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is
in theaters this Friday.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:10.744 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Let's take a look.

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:14.614 align:start size:94% position:6%
-My husband is joining me here
the day after tomorrow.

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:20.153
I told him that I would
charter a boat for fishing tuna.

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:23.390 align:start size:94% position:6%
I want you
to take him out on your boat,

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:26.726 size:75% position:38% line:92%
let him get drunk...

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:29.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
then drop him in the ocean
for the sharks.

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:31.931
-Please welcome back to the show
Anne Hathaway, everyone!

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:34.200 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:44.210 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:52.152 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:53.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey!
-How are you?

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:55.388
-I'm so good, thank you.
-It's wonderful to see you.

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:58.958 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have to say, sometimes
you show a clip from a movie,

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:01.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
and people
can't glean the plot from it.

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:04.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
But that really laid it out.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:04.764 line:92%
But this has been a movie

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:06.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's been shrouded
in secrecy, to some degree.

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Yeah.
-So, has it been hard for you

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:10.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
to talk about it
even during the filming of it?

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:13.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It wasn't hard
during the filming of it.

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:16.843 size:78% position:39%
It's a twisted movie
with a lot of twists.

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:19.279 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-So, that part's just been

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:20.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
really --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.248 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What happened?

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:24.317 line:92%
Oh, man, it went over my head.

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:26.753
So, yeah.
So in that sense, I don't know,

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:29.089 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's been kind of fun
gleaning into the mystery

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:30.290 line:92%
and not giving too much away.

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:33.359 size:81% position:41%
-A lot of this movie
takes place on a boat.

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-And because of that,

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:37.697 align:start size:94% position:6%
I imagine that you,
on long days of shooting,

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:39.399 align:start size:94% position:6%
where you're on a boat
in the middle of the ocean,

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:41.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
you want to bring essentials
onto the boat.

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:43.436
Were there things you had to
have over the course of the day?

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:45.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah.
I love being out on boats,

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:48.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
so thankfully, I didn't
need to bring any Dramamine

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
or anything like that.
-Yeah.

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:50.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, I was like,
"Okay. What do I want?

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:52.679
I'll probably want a book
for in between takes."

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:56.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
And what else?
Well, sunscreen's a good idea.

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:57.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm gonna bring
an espresso machine."

00:01:57.717 --> 00:01:58.952 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
-'Cause I just thought,

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:00.587 align:start size:94% position:6%
"We're gonna be out there
all day long,

00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:03.523
and I bet they're not gonna have
great coffee on the crew boat."

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:05.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so, I'm like, "I'm gonna
have an espresso machine,

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:07.627
and everybody's gonna be tired,
but it's gonna be okay,

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:10.063 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I'm gonna show up with
this Nespresso for them.

00:02:10.063 --> 00:02:13.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
By the way, I'm not shilling
for Nespresso right now.

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:13.867 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.867 --> 00:02:17.070
I'm not taking over for George.
So, anyways...

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:20.306 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I show up thinking that
I'm gonna do this great thing,

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:21.007 line:92%
and I'm like, "Hey, guys,

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:22.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
where can I plug in
my Nespresso machine."

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:23.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're like,
"This is a movie boat.

00:02:23.877 --> 00:02:26.379 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can't plug it in anywhere.
This isn't real."

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:28.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"Okay. Well, what do we do?"

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:29.349 size:78% position:39% line:92%
They said, "Hold on."

00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:31.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they bring
this massive generator --

00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:33.686 size:88% position:44%
this, like, gas-powered
generator onto the boat.

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:36.789 size:84% position:42%
They're like, "Hang on!
Hathaway wants coffee!"

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:37.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-"Rrrrr!"

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:40.793
And then just this nice thing
that I wanted to do for everyone

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:43.463
turned into the biggest
diva request of all time.

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:46.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was so embarrassed.
-Just based on the gas alone,

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:48.301 align:start size:94% position:6%
each cup of espresso
is like $45.

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:49.569 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, terrible.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:53.540 align:start size:94% position:6%
Mama Earth.
-You shot in Mauritius, yes?

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.641
-Yes.
-I'm saying that right, I hope.

00:02:54.641 --> 00:02:57.010 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Mauritius -- yes, you are.
-And you have --

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:58.912 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have children,
very similar ages.

00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:01.414
Did you bring your son with you?
-Yes, of course.

00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:02.916 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, we were there --
It was so far away,

00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:04.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we were there
for a long time.

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:06.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And did he enjoy it?
Was --

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:09.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think we're like days apart.
When was your --

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:11.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
-March 24th.
-And March 27th.

00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:14.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, really, they're the same.
They're the same child.

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:19.232 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:24.137
But my son loves the beach
and things like that, swimming.

00:03:24.137 --> 00:03:26.372
-Is yours there, as well?
Does he like those things?

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:28.041 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Oh, yeah, he loves it.

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:30.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was really
into "Moana" at the time.

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:31.077 align:start size:94% position:6%
Your son's Ash, right?
-Yeah.

00:03:31.077 --> 00:03:34.080
-Was he into "Moana"?
-He does not know who Moana is.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:36.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, my son
had a crush on Moana.

00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:39.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
My son's playing hard-to-get.

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:41.788 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.788 --> 00:03:43.022 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-So, my son thought --

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:45.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
We took him to Mauritius,
which is paradise.

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:46.626 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's so beautiful.

00:03:46.626 --> 00:03:49.329
And so, I think he thought
that we were in Motunui.

00:03:49.329 --> 00:03:50.697 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, I don't know
if you've ever seen a picture

00:03:50.697 --> 00:03:54.734
of Matthew McConaughey's wife,
but she is the most drop-dead

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:56.369 line:92%
gorgeous Brazilian woman,

00:03:56.369 --> 00:03:58.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she kind of
looks like Moana.

00:03:58.071 --> 00:04:01.007 size:75% position:38%
So, my son was like,
"What is happening?

00:04:01.007 --> 00:04:03.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
What is this
crystal ocean and her?"

00:04:03.443 --> 00:04:06.179
And so Camila would come around,
and my son would just, like,

00:04:06.179 --> 00:04:07.347 line:92%
get this look on his face.

00:04:07.347 --> 00:04:09.082
And I realized he was completely
in love with her.

00:04:09.082 --> 00:04:10.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's fantastic!
-Yeah.

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Does he have --
How's his sense of humor?

00:04:12.518 --> 00:04:16.055
Because that has been my
favorite thing to watch develop.

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:16.956 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-He's delightful.

00:04:16.956 --> 00:04:18.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's delightful,
and he loves laughing.

00:04:18.191 --> 00:04:19.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's a generous laugher.
-That's nice.

00:04:19.926 --> 00:04:20.793 line:92%
-You know, we were at the park.

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:22.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was at the park with him
just before this.

00:04:22.629 --> 00:04:23.796 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you know that
you do that thing where

00:04:23.796 --> 00:04:26.633
you kind of be a monster and you
come at them really slowly,

00:04:26.633 --> 00:04:29.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they just fill up
with joy and joy,

00:04:29.335 --> 00:04:31.271 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then they can't keep it in
and they laugh.

00:04:31.271 --> 00:04:33.339 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, that was really sweet.
What does Ash do?

00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:34.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ash is --
we feel as though,

00:04:34.974 --> 00:04:36.442 align:start size:94% position:6%
the other day,
we got our first joke,

00:04:36.442 --> 00:04:38.511 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is,
my wife made him breakfast,

00:04:38.511 --> 00:04:40.213 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he ate the whole thing,
and then he was went,

00:04:40.213 --> 00:04:42.282 line:92%
"Who made this breakfast?"

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:43.516 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.516 --> 00:04:44.350 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And that made us laugh.

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:48.488
And then before we could answer,
he goes, "Maybe a monkey?"

00:04:48.488 --> 00:04:51.024 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:51.024 --> 00:04:52.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you're like,
"Every part of that,"

00:04:52.625 --> 00:04:54.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like, "that's fantastic."
-That's fantastic.

00:04:54.627 --> 00:04:56.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's gonna crush harder
with us right now

00:04:56.996 --> 00:04:58.331 line:92%
than anything I do tonight.

00:04:58.331 --> 00:04:59.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, I'm prepping
a character right now,

00:04:59.832 --> 00:05:02.368
and she's really animated
in her facial expressions,

00:05:02.368 --> 00:05:04.237 size:75% position:38%
and I was wearing --
We had to do a test

00:05:04.237 --> 00:05:05.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we didn't
have the right wig,

00:05:05.371 --> 00:05:06.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
so my hair looked
a little weird.

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:09.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so I'm FaceTiming
with Jonathan, and I'm like,

00:05:09.409 --> 00:05:11.611
"Maybe I can just practice
the facial expressions on him."

00:05:11.611 --> 00:05:14.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I'm doing it for him,
and I give him this big smile,

00:05:14.514 --> 00:05:17.483 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he goes,
"Mama, what are you doing?"

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:18.651 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:18.651 --> 00:05:19.619 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I was like, "Okay.

00:05:19.619 --> 00:05:21.421 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maybe I'll tone it down
a little bit.

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:23.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, if you lose
your 2 1/2-year-old,

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:26.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
you've lost the whole country.
-Definitely.

